  "description": "The VIVI FatGo1 is the ideal choice for riders who value stability, comfort, and exceptional practicality. Featuring a 750W peak-power motor, a 48V 13.5Ah removable battery, a differential, and a parking brake system, it is designed to enhance your modern lifestyle. It has passed the UL 2849 safety standard certification, providing you with a high-end functional experience and excellent cost performance. Whether you need a convenient way to run errands or commute in the city, or simply want a safe, effortless vehicle for outdoor excursions, the VIVI FatGo1 integrates seamlessly into your lifestyle—allowing you to fully enjoy the freedom of a stable ride and the convenience of urban living.\n\n750W peak powerful rear drive motor, 60Nm torque\nRemovable 48V 13.5Ah 648Wh lithium-ion battery\nSpeed differential mechanism and Parking brake\nIntelligent 5 level pedal assist and Digital LCD display\nBright headlight and rear reflector light\nAmple storage space & high load capacity\nwalking assist mode are more suitable for women & elder\n\nSGS certified to UL2849 & UL2271 safety standards",
